window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b><i>\"Blood is the liberator. Blood is the destroyer. Blood is the answer.\"</i></b></p> <p>Faith Deverell has spent twenty years hiding in the remote Scottish Highlands, concealing a heritage that makes her unique among both mortals and immortals. As the first vampire born rather than turned, she's fought to suppress powers that could make her either humanity's greatest protector—or its worst nightmare.</p> <p>But her carefully constructed isolation shatters when ancient enemies descend. Hunted by forces she barely comprehends, Faith finds hope in very unexpected allies. Together, they unearth a terrifying truth: Faith is more than just a vampire hybrid—she's the key to unleashing something terrifying.</p> <p>As supernatural powers converge and long-buried secrets resurface, Faith must finally embrace her true nature to prevent an apocalypse that threatens both human and immortal worlds. But accepting her destiny may cost her everything—and everyone—she holds dear.</p> <p><i>Faith</i> continues the sweeping Red Claws saga, weaving together vampire mythology, forbidden romance, and heart-pounding action in a story about the price of destiny and the power of choice.</p> <p><b>The darkness is rising. Which side will she choose?</b></p>"; 
